# DentCast Cursor live modular routing

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Read complete archived global rules: `.dentcast/workflows/legacy/cursor/dentcast-router.mdc`, `AGENTS.legacy.md` §§6–8 and `CLAUDE.legacy.md`, plus the whole `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md`.

**New content → `.dentcast/workflows/README.md`.** Read full `modules/01-hard-rules.md`, `02-routing-intake.md` and each applicable stage slice. Full original `.dentcast/workflows/README.legacy.md` wins for rule priority, approvals, completeness and conflicts.

Specialty requests keep their original routes: English → `en-version.md`; ads → `ads.md`; ad stats → `spot-report.md`; glossary drafting → `.claude/skills/glossary-writer/SKILL.md`; cross-link → `cross-link.md`; offline → `.dentcast/offline-publish.md`; new section → `new-section.md`; external Fidelity → `external-fidelity.md`.

Real publication actions are permitted **only under all original human/science/verification gates**. Synthetic staging tools and hash receipts never grant permission or replace execution.
